quests.desc:
The &#94C0E3Processing Array&r is a large multiblock that allows you to simulate machines running in parallel. Maximum parallel operations are &#94E3A264&r.

To build the multiblock, firstly select the amount of parallel machines you wish to simulate in the GUI of the controller block.

{image:atm:textures/questpics/modernindustrialization/proc_array_gui.png width:175 height:100 align:center}

{@pagebreak}
To use the machine, you need to put the machine you want to simulate into the slot on the right side of GUI. You need the same amount of machines as you want operations.

Also, &#94C0E3Processing Array&r accepts normally all the upgrades as well.

The &#49C472Nuclear Reactor&r allows you to process for higher end resources. We will be using it to generate &#8F49C4Deuterium&r and &#EB5266Tritium&r.

This resource list will help you build a "Large" Reactor. Any smaller size is not recommended due to its speed and efficiency.
{@pagebreak}
The details of making an efficient reactor are far too complicated to be provided here. I will provide you with the best designs possible here though.

Here is a &#49C472Large Reactor&r design to produce &#8F49C4Deuterium&r.
{image:atm:textures/questpics/modernindustrialization/large_reactor.png width:100 height:100 align:center}

This is the &#49C472Extreme sized Reactor&r design to produce &#EB5266Tritium&r.

{image:atm:textures/questpics/modernindustrialization/largest_reactor.png width:100 height:100 align:center}
